#%RAML 1.0 DataType
(package): Agent
type: AgentResponsesSuccess
displayName: AgentResponsesQuoteRequestSuccess
discriminatorValue: QuoteRequest
description: |
  Successful `201` response from a [/responses](/api/agents/intake-agent#create-a-cart-or-quote-request) request when `outputType` is `QuoteRequest`.
example: !include ../../examples/agent/AgentResponsesQuoteRequestSuccess.json
properties:
  entity:
    type: QuoteRequest
    description: |
      The created [QuoteRequest](ctp:api:type:QuoteRequest) in full commercetools REST representation.
  cartId:
    type: string
    description: |
      `id` of the underlying [Cart](ctp:api:type:Cart).
